# DEVELOPMENT WORKFLOW
# =============================================================================
#
# After installing dev dependencies:
#
# 1. Set up pre-commit hooks:
#    pre-commit install
#
# 2. Run tests:
#    pytest tests/ -v --cov=src --cov-report=html
#
# 3. Run linter:
#    ruff check src/ tests/
#    ruff format src/ tests/
#
# 4. Run type checker:
#    mypy src/
#
